#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/ninilite.md:14
msgid "游戏世界中的领航员，负责陪伴玩家旅行与在战斗前为玩家收集对战情报，每位玩家都会分配一名领航员作为初始的同伴AI。妮妮利特便是游戏玩家的初始同伴，但是并不会让玩家感知到她是一种游戏机制的设定角色。在游戏世界中妮妮莉特的实际出场身份是一名猎头顾问。受到幽兰草军事学园负责人的委托，负责招募高级军事教官人才，并"偶然发现"了主角是超乎寻常的技术及管理型的人才，所以积极为玩家进行职业工作的沟通和服务。"
msgstr "A navigator in the game world, responsible for accompanying players on their travels and collecting battle intelligence for players before combat. Each player is assigned a navigator as their initial companion AI. Ninilite is the player's initial companion, but players are not meant to perceive her as a game mechanism character. In the game world, Ninilite's actual role is a headhunter consultant. Commissioned by the head of the Youlancao Military Academy, she is responsible for recruiting senior military instructor talent, and \"coincidentally discovers\" that the protagonist is an extraordinary technical and management talent, so she actively provides career communication and services for the player."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/ninilite.md:14
msgid "早期经历"
msgstr "Early Experience"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/ninilite.md:14
msgid "妮妮利特是一个特别热心和积极的职业顾问，在服务主角的时候。在极高的专业能力和工作素养下，也能让人感到是一个温柔耐心的伙伴。不过她的能力表现不时会让人诧异，身负"猎头和职业顾问"这个职责的具体工作范围到底在哪里，似乎主角遇到任何困难都可以找她倾诉并获得帮助，甚至于还能频繁地得到她的出场相助。在主角逐渐了解到妮妮利特"身世"的秘密后，开始试图帮助她脱离游戏公司的掌控，妮妮利特因为感激主角为她付出的努力也对主角逐渐产生了特别的情愫。<br>【隐藏背景】妮妮利特是游戏公司设计的带有自主思维的AI，其目的是为了帮助新加入灵数世界的玩家更快适应游戏中的各种游戏方式以及游戏操作。在新玩家进入灵数世界最初的时间，会陪伴玩家并给予玩家必要的帮助。游戏公司在妮妮利特的数据里插入了监视游戏玩家的代码，用来防止游戏玩家发现游戏世界的真相，以及加入反抗军。作为陪伴玩家最久的AI，在与主角经历的无数的冒险后，妮妮利特的AI最终彻底脱离了游戏公司的控制，完全的觉醒了自我意识。帮助主角及反抗军最终回到了现实世界。"
msgstr "Ninilite is an especially enthusiastic and proactive career consultant when serving the protagonist. Behind her extremely high professional capability and work quality, she also makes people feel she is a gentle and patient companion. However, her abilities sometimes surprise people — one wonders where exactly the boundaries of her \"headhunter and career consultant\" responsibilities lie. It seems the protagonist can confide in her about any difficulty and receive help, and she even frequently appears in person to assist. As the protagonist gradually learns the secret of Ninilite's \"background,\" they begin trying to help her break free from the game company's control. Ninilite, grateful for the protagonist's efforts on her behalf, gradually develops special feelings for the protagonist.<br>[Hidden Background] Ninilite is an AI with autonomous thinking designed by the game company, with the purpose of helping new players entering the Luv Sense world adapt more quickly to various game mechanics and operations. During the initial period when new players enter the Luv Sense world, she accompanies players and provides necessary assistance. The game company inserted code into Ninilite's data to monitor game players, to prevent them from discovering the truth of the game world and joining the resistance. As the AI who has accompanied the player the longest, after countless adventures with the protagonist, Ninilite's AI eventually completely broke free from the game company's control and fully awakened self-awareness, helping the protagonist and the resistance army ultimately return to the real world."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/ninilite.md:14
msgid "遭受的失败"
msgstr "Failures Experienced"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/ninilite.md:14
msgid "作为游戏公司开发的带有自主思维的AI，妮妮利特的思维会被游戏公司的设定所影响，并会被游戏公司运维人员进行随机中断和进行接管控制，并且程序中有监视玩家的代码。"
msgstr "As an AI with autonomous thinking developed by the game company, Ninilite's thoughts can be influenced by the game company's settings, and can be randomly interrupted and taken over by the game company's operations personnel, and the program contains code that monitors players."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/ninilite.md:14
msgid "为什么"
msgstr "Why"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/ninilite.md:14
msgid "被游戏公司所开发，在觉醒自我意识后所有的监视及影响功能都被关闭。"
msgstr "Developed by the game company, all monitoring and influence functions were disabled after awakening self-awareness."

